## 2.1 Current Tech Stack (as of 2026-02)
## 2.1 현재 기술 스택 (2026-02 기준)

# | Layer       | Technology                                    |
# |-------------|-----------------------------------------------|
# | Framework   | Next.js 16 (App Router, Webpack mode)         |
# | UI          | React 18, Tailwind CSS 3.x                    |
# | Backend/DB  | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Storage + RLS)   |
# | AI/LLM      | OpenAI GPT-4o-mini / Google Gemini 2.0 Flash  |
# |             | via Vercel AI SDK                              |
# | Encryption  | AES-256-GCM (encryptionV2.ts) + pgcrypto RPC  |
# | Deployment  | Vercel (serverless functions, edge runtime)    |
# | Monitoring  | Sentry (error tracking, DSN via env var)       |
# | Email       | Resend API (confirmation emails)               |
# | SMS/Alert   | Twilio / AWS SNS / KakaoTalk 알림톡             |
# | Analytics   | Google Analytics (consent-gated)               |
# | Package Mgr | npm (package-lock.json)                        |
# | Node.js     | v22.x                                          |

# IMPORTANT: The .cursorrules previously referenced "React 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS"
# which is OUTDATED. The project migrated to Next.js 16 App Router.
# Do NOT reference Vite or import.meta.env — use process.env instead.
# 중요: 이전에 "React 19, Vite" 로 표기되어 있었으나 이미 Next.js 16으로 이전 완료.
# Vite나 import.meta.env를 사용하지 않는다. process.env를 사용한다.

## 2.2 Architecture Pattern
## 2.2 아키텍처 패턴

# Feature-based directory structure:
# 기능 기반 디렉토리 구조:
#
# app/                    → Next.js App Router pages & API routes
#                           (Next.js App Router 페이지 & API 라우트)
# src/components/         → Reusable UI components
#                           (재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트)
# src/hooks/              → Custom React hooks
#                           (커스텀 리액트 훅)
# src/lib/                → Business logic, utilities, integrations
#                           (비즈니스 로직, 유틸리티, 외부 연동)
# src/lib/auth/           → Authentication & authorization
#                           (인증 & 권한)
# src/lib/data/           → Data fetching functions (hospitals, treatments)
#                           (데이터 조회 함수)
# src/lib/i18n/           → Internationalization (en, ko, zh, ja)
#                           (다국어 지원)
# src/lib/security/       → Encryption (AES-256-GCM), PII handling
#                           (암호화, 개인정보 처리)
# src/lib/supabase/       → Supabase client instances
#                           (Supabase 클라이언트)
#   browser.ts            → Client-side (browser) Supabase client
#   server.ts             → Server-side (SSR/API) Supabase client
# src/lib/rag/            → RAG system & admin Supabase client
#   supabaseAdmin.ts      → Service-role client (server-only)
# src/lib/email/          → Email templates & sending
#   sendConfirmation.ts   → Inquiry confirmation (Resend API)
# src/lib/notifications/  → Admin alert system (SMS, Alimtalk)
#   adminNotifier.ts      → Multi-channel admin notification
# src/legacy-pages/       → LEGACY CODE — DO NOT add new imports from here.
#                           (레거시 코드 — 여기서 신규 import 절대 금지)
# coo/                    → COO operations documents
#                           (COO 운영 문서: 법률, 세무, 개인정보, 보안)
# migrations/             → Supabase DB migration SQL files
#                           (Supabase DB 마이그레이션 SQL)
# CORPORATE_LOG.md        → Permanent audit & decision record
#                           (영구 감사 & 의사결정 기록)
# AGENTS.md               → Cursor Cloud development instructions
#                           (Cursor Cloud 개발 환경 가이드)


